Where each of the old tests went
===============================

The suite was rewritten from 36 hand-written files into scenarios built
from plugins (see DESIGN).  This file records where every old file's
coverage ended up, so that the rewrite can be checked for lost ground
rather than taken on trust.  It is written as the port proceeds, not
reconstructed afterwards.

The pgbench schema provides a background workload in every scenario;
dimensions that need their own invariant get a schema decorator that
adds its own table, plus the load and check that go with it.

